{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hobbycraft-sand-and-pom-pom-art-kit-2602-0017","content_id":"1cc5be4a-db46-4db4-9533-a6b93b65f16b","description":"Product Recall for Hobbycraft Sand and Pom Pom Art Kit presenting a health risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e9ef5d6d-38e8-47f2-a6d9-8341bdab5199","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-28T12:00:00+01:00","id":"e9ef5d6d-38e8-47f2-a6d9-8341bdab5199","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-28T12:00:00+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a18203059fb7a60f827f43b/2602-0017-product-recall-hobbycraft-sand-and-pom-pom-art-kit.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Hobbycraft Sand and Pom Pom Art Kit</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk to health as the sand included in the set may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Hobbycraft.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment – Arts/Crafts/Needlework Sand Supplies</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Hobbycraft</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>Fox and Sloth</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Code</td>\n      <td>6669851000</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Purchase Dates</td>\n      <td>October 2023 to January 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Fox and Sloth sand art kit, packaged in multicoloured packaging.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e9ef5d6d-38e8-47f2-a6d9-8341bdab5199\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a18203059fb7a60f827f43b/2602-0017-product-recall-hobbycraft-sand-and-pom-pom-art-kit.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk to health as the sand included in the set may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Hobbycraft.  </p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately and keep it out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the product. </p>\n\n<p>For further information, access the Hobbycraft website at:  <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.hobbycraft.co.uk/product-recall.html#sand-pom-pom-art-kit\">Sand and Pom Pom Recall</a> or call customer service on 0330 026 1400.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Stop using the product immediately. </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>If the sand is still in its packaging, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children. </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>If the sand has been used, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.  </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned. </p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Return the product to any Hobbycraft store for a full refund.</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>If you are unable to return the product to a Hobbycraft store, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>For further information, please contact the place of purchase, or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">OPSS page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2602-0017</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-04T15:01:36Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-04","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-04T15:01:36+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hobbycraft-sand-and-pom-pom-art-kit-2602-0017","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hobbycraft-sand-and-pom-pom-art-kit-2602-0017","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hobbycraft-sand-and-pom-pom-art-kit-2602-0017","content_id":"1cc5be4a-db46-4db4-9533-a6b93b65f16b"